    "text": "Clear, Haze, Fog, Rain, Low light \nUser-defined reduction in \ncontrast and brightness \n5. \nPlatform Motion \n\u00b1 20 pixels/frame (max.) \nUser selectable \nDefault/Mandatory: Linear \nOptional: Circular, random, \nspiral, figure of 8, etc. \nKey Milestones: \nExpected Solution: \nParticipants shall develop an AI-assisted camera tracking system capable of automatically detecting and \ncontinuously tracking a moving optical beacon in a simulated video stream while controlling a virtual pan-tilt \ncamera. \nThe developed software shall be able to:",
